                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.20/252: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Ford</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-11-04T16:00:00+03:25">November 4, 1943—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 5:48 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1047. Agreement covering engagement of Ridley Mission signed by Minister Dreyfus
                    and Foreign Minister November 3.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ford</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
